## EXECUTION IMPLICATIONS

### **What This Means for Your Team**

**For the CEO**:
- Focus: Weekly unit economics reviews
- Monthly: Traffic light status check
- Quarterly: OKR scoring and re-planning
- Don't get lost in daily ops; maintain strategic view

**For the Product Manager**:
- Build features that improve: pickup time, app rating, digital penetration
- Don't build features just because they're cool
- Every feature must map to an OKR

**For the Partner Manager**:
- Weekly: Partner churn rate, earnings consistency, SLA compliance
- Monthly: New partner onboarding (3-5/week target)
- Quarterly: Partner satisfaction survey, earnings adjustment review

**For Finance**:
- Weekly: Actual vs target on key metrics (GMV, revenue, CAC)
- Monthly: Full P&L, unit economics by city/segment
- Quarterly: Profitability analysis, margin trend analysis

