## RISK MITIGATION BUILT INTO RE-REVISION

**Risk 1: Platform fails; bookings don't scale**  
**Mitigation Built In**: Go/No-Go gate at Q1 end; if growth <30%, investigate before scaling

**Risk 2: Partners leave; fleet fragmentation**  
**Mitigation Built In**: Red flag at 15% churn; requirement to maintain 90%+ retention; weekly monitoring

**Risk 3: Unit economics break; margins compress**  
**Mitigation Built In**: Cost control target <30%; margin floor targets; if CAC >₹250, stop acquisition

**Risk 4: City expansion doesn't replicate; each city unique**  
**Mitigation Built In**: <3 month payback requirement per city; clear city selection criteria in Objective 3

